  designNotes: "Beat 1: teach the drag. Deliberately the softest line in the game
    \u2014 one small objective, no elevation, no threat priority. Garrison raised
    3->5 of 9 so the outpost reads as the target rather than as scenery (rule 5);
    the ground group stays wide and forgiving because a first multi-kill is the whole
    point. 2026-08-20 range trial: outpost 7->9, ground squad 4.5->6.5 (unsigned)."
